*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0038
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 212
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0038.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0038C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 EXCESS-FEE         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "EXCESS-FEE=" EXCESS-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF TXN-COUNT-MTH GREATER THAN 10
        COMPUTE EXCESS-FEE ROUNDED = (TXN-COUNT-MTH - 10) * 0.25
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'B'
       AND TXN-COUNT-MTH GREATER THAN 40
        ADD 10 TO EXCESS-FEE
    END-IF.
